"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったんがずっと離れなくて、名前連呼されてました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのせいなのか、お渡し会のペアは見事ゆったんと同じレーンに笑(〃▽〃)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分が引く前に、「まいやん13引いてね！」って優里に言われて、引いた紙見てびっくり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この日は、何かが通じ合ってたみたいね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ、いつもか(〃▽〃)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"抽選終わってからも、ステージ裏で優里は私の足にしがみついていました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/mai.shiraishi/img/2013/12/11/5158086/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛いやつだな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と思いきや、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/mai.shiraishi/img/2013/12/11/5158086/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"強引にお尻チェック"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お巡りさーん、ここに変態がいまーす！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもこれもいつものこと笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break